  "editorial": {
    "name": "Arena by Dravensoft",
    "descriptionZh": "Dravensoft 的 Arena 设计系统：同一份 contract 同时产出 React 和 Angular 两套 73 个组件，配色与字体由项目自己的 arena.config.json 决定，仓库是 MIT。",
    "descriptionEn": null,
    "takeawayZh": "装一份包，同时拿到 React 与 Angular 两个版本。",
    "noteZh": "首屏黑底一行大字 Arena by Dravensoft，副标题是 One design system, in React and in Angular, from one contract.。图里用八颗 Publish 按钮演示同一个组件在不同项目里的样子（booking、project-tracker、language-course、storefront 与 photo-feed、observability-console、document-workspace、inbox），左侧注解 contracts/behaviour 与 contracts/api 分别管行为与 API，下方一句 Arena carries the language and never the skin.。页面还挂着 See it / Benches / Take it 三块，Benches 里是 Calendly、ClickUp、Duolingo、Etsy、Grafana、Instagram、Notion、Superhuman 各一对 React 与 Angular 实现，安装命令是 bun add @dravensoft/arena-react 或 @dravensoft/arena-angular，Take it 段说明仓库是 MIT。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
